  "body": "A truly unique opportunity awaits an astute buyer ready to turn their ultimate vision into reality. \r\n\r\nNestled in a highly sought-after pocket of prime Gulf Harbour, this spectacular, elevated 1,000 square metre section offers the perfect foundation for a life of coastal luxury.\r\n\r\nA previous Resource Consent and Building Consent, with stunning plans, are available.  You can capitalise on the extensive groundwork that has already been completed, fast-tracking the journey to your new front door.\r\n\r\nBathed in sunshine and elevated by design, this perfectly positioned section on a brilliant north-facing slope, promises a home bathed in all-day, sun-drenched warmth. The elevated vantage point not only guarantees glorious natural light but sets the stage for a spectacular architectural design that captures sweeping coastal breezes and beautiful outlooks.\r\n\r\nCall now for further details or swing by and take a look for yourself.",
